evidence-0eba-11991/static-checks.log` exits `MECHANISM_DELTA_EXIT=0`. Output is `active=682 new=24 increased=0 stale=0` followed by admitted entries, including `test_helper::tests/_sandbox_capabilities.py — 985f-0ec5-a61c-46ee`; therefore there are 0 new unadmitted mechanisms. |\n\nRecommendation: 8 of 9 can honestly be ticked from the available evidence. Criterion 5 should stay unticked until a per-test CI artifact or verbose CI rerun proves all 4 affected tests executed rather than skipped; the current evidence proves successful CI and exactly-4 local skip accounting, but not per-test non-skip outcomes for all 4 in CI."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789780857136901934,"uuid":"120c9837-1983-4c63-b146-7b32d1273208"}